    "body": "> As long as it’s being made permanent, we should also make the ID `form-submission-section` (or something), rather than `form-submission-2`…\r\n\r\nTo be more precise: I think what should best happen is that a second new ID should added that takes readers to that same heading. The `form-submission-2` ID is generated, and should continue to work (though, as with all number-postfixed generated IDs, if another reference to `form submission` is added to the spec source somewhere before that section, `https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#form-submission-2` is no longer going to take users the heading/section it now does…).",
