    "updated_at": "2020-06-25T17:53:00Z",
    "body": "OK, so we now have https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#form-submission as the better permanent anchor for this. https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#form-submission-2 still works, and if you'd like we can make both permanent anchors; let us know.\r\n\r\nLet's consider this clause now in force for `#form-submission`:\r\n\r\n> After discussion concludes, such requested anchors get promoted to be permanent. This means that it becomes a matter of WHATWG Policy to never break them without the requestor's assent.\r\n\r\nand we're happy to add `#form-submission-2` as well if you'd like. I filed https://github.com/whatwg/html-build/issues/304 to properly take care of\r\n\r\n> (This is enforced via technical means in the specification tooling.)\r\n\r\nand would like to keep this issue open until that's done.",
